  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "正式向你道歉  (A Formal Apology From Chun Yuqiao)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After both red-carpet commentators stubbornly refuse to apologise first, Bu Xiaogu vents to Xingzi in the corridor just as Chun Yuqiao walks up behind her with an unexpected apology of his own. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，萧尧和吕怡这两个人实在是太难搞了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们就是不肯公开道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他们两个人怎么说的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一个不肯低头，另一个说必须先私下向他道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们在这儿说谁呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷，上次我说话有点重，对不起。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我在正式向你道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您真的不用给我道歉，我真没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "接受吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，谢谢淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，萧尧和吕怡这两个人实在是太难搞了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, Xiao Yao and Lv Yi are honestly impossible to deal with.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们就是不肯公开道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They flatly refuse to apologise in public.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他们两个人怎么说的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did the two of them say?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一个不肯低头，另一个说必须先私下向他道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One refuses to bow her head, and the other demands a private apology first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们在这儿说谁呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are you two talking about over here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷，上次我说话有点重，对不起。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu, I spoke rather harshly last time; I am sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is alright, Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我在正式向你道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am formally apologising to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您真的不用给我道歉，我真没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really do not need to apologise to me; I am truly fine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "接受吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just accept it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，谢谢淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, thank you, Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
